      "content": "wait really?? i thought my doctor said swelling was totally normal for the first week. i'm also feeling a bit lightheaded and my breathing feels a little heavy... i feel like it might just be the pain meds or being tired from the surgery. are you sure i need to go to the ER for just a calf issue?",
